                        "email": "jae.yoo@oss.qualcomm.com",
                        "username": "jaehyoo"
                    },
                    "message": "It couldn't cover a case when UDC is already bound, right?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "create_usbhid.sh",
                    "line": 147,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Hariharan Rangasamy",
                        "email": "hariharanr@ami.com",
                        "username": "hariharanrangasamy"
                    },
                    "message": "Nuvoton is not port oriented so it will not have :pN style."
                },
                {
                    "file": "create_usbhid.sh",
                    "line": 147,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jae Hyun Yoo",
                        "email": "jae.yoo@oss.qualcomm.com",
                        "username": "jaehyoo"
                    },
                    "message": "I meant a case where the UDC is already bound. In that case 'Device or resource busy' error could be returned. In case of Aspeed flow, there is a guard to prevent the case but it does not."
                },
